sections.s5b_flow:
```
  ═══ COMPOSITE PRIMARY KEY ═══

  Table: daily_balances
  PK: (account_id, balance_date)  ← TWO columns together = unique

  ═══ @EmbeddedId APPROACH ═══

  @Embeddable record DailyBalanceId(accountId, balanceDate) implements Serializable {}
  @Entity class DailyBalance { @EmbeddedId DailyBalanceId id; BigDecimal balance; }
  Access: entity.getId().accountId()

  ═══ @IdClass APPROACH (alternative) ═══

  record DailyBalanceId(accountId, balanceDate) implements Serializable {}
  @Entity @IdClass(DailyBalanceId.class)
  class DailyBalance { @Id String accountId; @Id LocalDate balanceDate; BigDecimal balance; }
  Access: entity.getAccountId()  (flatter — fields on entity directly)

  ═══ KEY CLASS REQUIREMENTS ═══

  Must implement: Serializable
  Must override: equals() + hashCode() (JPA identity comparison + caching)
  Java record: auto-generates ALL THREE → zero boilerplate!

  ═══ WHEN TO USE WHICH ═══

  @EmbeddedId: key is a first-class object, cleaner JPQL, preferred for new code
  @IdClass:    flatter entity fields, legacy schemas, some Spring Data quirks
```
